# described here fails at the fetch, for everyone, permanently. A tag is a name
# upstream has published and does not move. This one is also what the official
# pi0-smartcard device image is built from, so the simulator and the physical
# device run the same code. The sha is still the pin; the tag only says which
# release it is.
